# Build output — regenerate with `node build.mjs`. Never commit it: it is
# derived from src/, and committing it means every content edit shows up as a
# diff across nine HTML files.
dist/

# Nothing here needs npm, but keep these out if a tool ever adds them.
node_modules/
package-lock.json

.DS_Store
*.log

# Wrangler's local cache.
.wrangler/

# Working folders that came across when this project moved here. Neither is
# part of the website:
#   ecell/     — a clone of the dhatchinamoorthiat-star/E-Cell repo (the
#                Supabase "Control Room" platform), cloned only to check
#                whether it held this site's source. It does not.
#   site-live/ — a mirror of the OLD live site, kept as the content reference
#                while rebuilding. Every fact in it now lives in src/data/.
# Both are safe to delete once you are happy with the rebuild.
ecell/
site-live/

# NOT ignored, on purpose:
#   src/public/og.png, icon-*.png, logo*.png  — generated, but committed so a
#     normal build never needs Chrome (see tools/make-og.mjs, make-logo.mjs)
#   src/logo.jpeg, src/logo-ref.jpeg          — the supplied brand artwork,
#     the source the PNGs are derived from
#   src/public/vendor/                        — the vendored QR encoder
